{
	"description": "Cases for a plugin bundle's manifest (phase 5 no-terminal amendment, 4.4), run by @lushly-dev/loam-manifest's read-plugin.test.ts and meant for loam-desktop's Rust inspect (step 9c). Each case is `base` with its `patch` applied as an RFC 7386 JSON merge patch (null removes a key; an array is replaced whole). `refused` lists every refusal by code and key, in no order; `appCases` add each app's packed manifest, as much of it as the rules read. `bundleDigest` is the amendment's 7.1 digest of a bundle's files, each given by its path and its bytes' SHA-256, computed apart from either implementation.",
